{"title":"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/7637fe044dd52a13b24fee4cdc9f8d5f274d9a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$@$\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" /> denote the \"averaged with\" operation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/7/4e768d2fee3b5f8c30d5bbc6b77646148ae0b7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a @ b = \\frac{a+b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"98\" height=\"37\" />. Which of the following distributive laws hold for all numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b56d32444d8efd65eb0cb6c01f8ac72c32587e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"32\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />? <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12dc1d88f7d35e87ea9ea35f7dad4d9c92214d24.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{I. x @ (y + z) = (x @ y) + (x @ z)}\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/28722502a9a6fb1ef5bc3f366283389f0ab6c39b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{II. x + (y @ z) = (x + y) @ (x + z)}\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/b/92ba5c4645149e2c062620bbbf23b70a70b02479.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{III. x @ (y @ z) = (x @ y) @ (x @ z)}\\]\" width=\"268\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/9144bd2e58f81f0f48411b55ba10607957f33845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{I only} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{II only} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{III only} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{I and III only} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{II and III only}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"655\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify each operation and see which ones hold true.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/9/2d912c0803493e63cfa74c9cf60c70c0f563a84c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\text{I.} \\qquad x @ (y + z) &amp;= (x @ y) + (x @ z)\\\\ \\frac{x+y+z}{2} &amp;= \\frac{x+y}{2} + \\frac{x+z}{2}\\\\ \\frac{x+y+z}{2} &amp;\\not= \\frac{2x+y+z}{2} \\end{align*}\" width=\"264\" height=\"104\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/0/bb0e237c5266c23e5c63f1cf7c254df9d92620d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\text{II.} \\qquad x + (y @ z) &amp;= (x + y) @ (x + z)\\\\ x+ \\frac{y+z}{2} &amp;= \\frac{2x+y+z}{2}\\\\ \\frac{2x+y+z}{2} &amp;= \\frac{2x+y+z}{2} \\end{align*}\" width=\"279\" height=\"106\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/5/e15acff11b04c19edbe6caef8d682afcd2f2d8ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\text{III.} \\qquad x @ (y @ z) &amp;= (x @ y) @ (x @ z)\\\\ x @ \\frac{y+z}{2} &amp;= \\frac{x+y}{2} @ \\frac{x+z}{2}\\\\ \\frac{2x+y+z}{4} &amp;= \\frac{2x+y+z}{4} \\end{align*}\" width=\"261\" height=\"105\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/e/9be161a4db3de48d64f2c63131e5b585ff287dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\text{II and III only}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"144\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alternatively, substitute arbitrary values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/b/64b0b15f6b595da31c740d814f0dad87134b9b0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq y\\neq z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47bce20bbdaf69387adff6c5d223526a36b91a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=3$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> give that only II and III work. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/e/9be161a4db3de48d64f2c63131e5b585ff287dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\text{II and III only}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"144\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B\">2011 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo